# COMMON ERRORS

## Authentication Error 190

Cause:

* expired Meta token

Fix:

* generate new token from Meta dashboard

---

## Webhook Verify Failed

Cause:

* wrong webhook URL
* forgot /webhook
* ngrok stopped
* wrong verify token

---

## Package Errors

Cause:

* packages not installed
* wrong Node.js version

Fix:

* reinstall packages
* restart terminal

---

## AI Model Errors

Cause:

* old SDK
* invalid model name
* expired API key

Fix:

* update AI package
* use latest supported model
* create new API key

